<img src="https://images.macrumors.com/article-new/2026/03/Ads-Are-Coming-to-Apple-Maps-Feature.jpg" alt="" width="160" height="90" class="alignleft size-full wp-image-1042317" />As reported <a href="https://www.mediapost.com/publications/article/417237/apple-officially-rolls-out-ads-in-maps.html">by <em>MediaPost</em></a>, businesses in the U.S. and Canada can <a href="https://ads.apple.com/maps">buy Apple Maps ad slots</a> starting today. An introductory offer provides advertisers with a 15% credit towards future ad spend, on up to &#36;1,000 per month of spend over the first year.<br/>
<br/>
